     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div>When trying to trap() arrivals, some of the arrivals are dropped from the simulation and finished is set to TRUE whereas I want to trap() them and have them wait() for a signal. Upon getting the signal and joining some trajectory() I immediatly untrap() the arrivals from the signal. My data contains around 6k arrivals, for about a 100 arrivals (not particularly different from the others) this occurs. It does not necessarily occur for the same arrivals when running the simulation multiple times. See: </div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/simmer-devel/attach/6deca34413506/Arrivals.PNG?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Arrivals.PNG\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"400\" height=\"103\"></div><div><br></div><div>The arrival times are unique for each arrival:</div><div><a style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/simmer-devel/attach/6deca34413506/ArrivalData.PNG?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"ArrivalData.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>In the example below, job5680 is unable to trap() whereas 5681 is able to do it. </div><div>Log:</div><div>1401.45: job5680: now in region1QueueTraject<br></div><div><div>[1] &quot;now in determine_if_wait_region1&quot;</div><div>[1] &quot;ended up in else if&quot;</div><div>[1] &quot;length of regionqueue is 21&quot;</div><div>1401.45: job5680: Returned a 2, my id is: 5680</div><div><br></div><div>1401.45: job5681: now in region2QueueTraject</div><div>[1] &quot;now in determine_if_wait_region2&quot;</div><div>[1] &quot;ended up in else if&quot;</div><div>[1] &quot;length of regionqueue is 21&quot;</div><div>1401.45: job5681: Returned a 2, my id is: 5681</div><div>[1] &quot;going to set my signal to 5681&quot;</div><div>1401.45: job5681: now in wait region 2</div></div><div><br></div><div>Code:</div><div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">determine_if_wait_region1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;now in determine_if_wait_region1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  availablePickersRegion1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> get_capacity</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">env</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pickOperatorRegion1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> get_server_count</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">env</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pickOperatorRegion1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">availablePickersRegion1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">regionqueue1_df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;going to increase winq&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    increase_WINQ</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;increased winq!&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    remove_job_from_regionqueu1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">availablePickersRegion1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">regionqueue1_df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ended up in else if&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;length of regionqueue is&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">regionqueue1_df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>set_signal </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;going to set my signal to&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> get_attribute</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">env</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  signal </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Request for job with id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> get_attribute</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">env</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">signal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>pickingRegion1Trajectory </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> trajectory</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Picking Process&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  untrap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> set_signal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  log_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Now in picking traject&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> get_attribute</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">env</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;region&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>region1QueueTraject </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> trajectory</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0