     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div>When trying to trap() arrivals, some of the arrivals are dropped from the simulation and finished is set to TRUE whereas I want to trap() them and have them wait() for a signal. Upon getting the signal and joining some trajectory() I immediatly untrap() the arrivals from the signal. My data contains around 6k arrivals, for about a 100 arrivals (not particularly different from the others) this occurs. It does not necessarily occur for the same arrivals when running the simulation multiple times. See: </div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/simmer-devel/attach/6325cd9bec8cc/Arrivals.PNG?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Arrivals.PNG\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"400\" height=\"103\"></div><div><br></div><div>The arrival times are unique for each arrival:</div><div><a style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/simmer-devel/attach/6325cd9bec8cc/ArrivalData.PNG?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"ArrivalData.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>In the example below, job5680 is unable to trap() whereas 5681 is able to do it. </div><div>Log:</div><div>1401.45: job5680: now in region1QueueTraject<br></div><div><div>[1] &quot;now in determine_if_wait_region1&quot;</div><div>[1] &quot;ended up in else if&quot;</div><div>[1] &quot;length of regionqueue is 21&quot;</div><div>1401.45: job5680: Returned a 2, my id is: 5680</div><div><br></div><div>1401.45: job5681: now in region2QueueTraject</div><div>[1] &quot;now in determine_if_wait_region2&quot;</div><div>[1] &quot;ended up in else if&quot;</div><div>[1] &quot;length of regionqueue is 21&quot;</div><div>1401.45: job5681: Returned a 2, my id is: 5681</div><div>[1] &quot;going to set my signal to 5681&quot;</div><div>1401.45: job5681: now in wait region 2</div></div><div><br></div><div>Code:</div><div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">determine_if_wait_region1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(){</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">print</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;now in determine_if_wait_region1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  availablePickersRegion1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> get_capacity</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">env</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;pickOperatorRegion1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> get_server_count</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">env</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;pickOperatorRegion1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color